        "original_id": "dffd2c80-768c-5cdb-be8a-b11e2959c2d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alvin Lee, Chad Gray\n- Organizations: Ten Years After, Hellyeah, Mudvayne\n- Products: Nineteen Ninety-Four, I Hear You Rockin'\n\nFacts:\n- Alvin Lee was born as Graham Anthony Barnes on 19 December 1944.\n- Alvin Lee was an English singer and guitarist.\n- Alvin Lee was best known as the lead vocalist and lead guitarist of the blues rock band Ten Years After.\n- Nineteen Ninety-Four is a 1994 album by Alvin Lee.\n- Nineteen Ninety-Four was released in the United States as I Hear You Rockin'.\n- Chad Gray was born on October 16, 1971.\n- Chad Gray is the lead vocalist for the groove metal supergroup Hellyeah.\n- Chad Gray was the former lead vocalist for the American heavy metal band Mudvayne.\n- Alvin Lee died on 6 March 2013.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
